# Files no project builds, tests or reads. Nx leaves them out of the graph, so
# editing them affects no project; the root project would otherwise own them and
# rerun the crate's suites for a docs or dev-environment change. README.md is not
# here: the crate packages it. Anything a target reads must never be listed.
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/docs/
# Agent, hook, judged-lint and shell/editor settings: read by those tools, never
# by an Nx target, except the repository settings covered by workflow tests.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
/lefthook.yml
/llmlint.yml
/oneharness.toml
/.envrc
/.editorconfig
